{
  "description": "Checks the title of a new task against what is already listed, as the user types and when it is added. Listed: every task that is not deleted and is either open (not done) or done today, whatever day it is planned for or in the inbox, and every routine whose latest version is not archived; a routine is done today when today's check has status done (skipped is open). `done_today` marks the ones done today, the rest are open. Titles are compared normalized as in title_suggestions (NFC, lowercase, ё → е, runs of non-letters/digits → one space, trim); an empty normalized title is free with nothing similar. If any listed item has the same normalized title: when one of them is open, the title is `taken` by the first open one in list order (the new task is not created); otherwise it is `done_today` (item: the first of them) and the task is offered under the next numbered title. Numbered title: a trimmed title ending in `(N)`, N being 1 to 9 ASCII digits, with a non-blank base before it (blanks between the base and `(` are dropped), has base and number N; any other title is its own trimmed base with number 0. The next title is `{base} ({n})`, base taken from the matched item's title, n = 1 + the highest number among listed items whose base is the same normalized; while the normalized next title equals that of a listed item, n goes up by one. Otherwise the title is free, and `similar` lists open items (done today ones never are) whose title shares more than half of the trigrams: trigrams of a normalized title are the 3-character windows of each word padded with two spaces before and one after (as in pg_trgm), as a set over all words; similar when 2·|A∩B| > |A∪B|. Order: |A∩B|/|A∪B| descending (compare as cross products of integers), then list order; at most `limit`. Expect: taken → {status, item}; done_today → {status, item, next}; free → {status, similar: [ids]}.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "an open task with the same title, in any case and punctuation, takes it",
      "input": {
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "task",
            "id": "t1",
            "title": "Выдать ВИП статус",
            "done_today": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "task",
            "id": "t2",
            "title": "Купить молоко",
            "done_today": false
          }
        ],
        "title": "выдать вип-статус",
        "limit": 3
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": "taken",
        "item": "t1"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a routine takes its title too",
      "input": {
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "task",
            "id": "t1",
            "title": "Купить молоко",
            "done_today": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "routine",
            "id": "r1",
            "title": "Обед",
            "done_today": false
          }
        ],
        "title": "Обед",
        "limit": 3
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": "taken",
        "item": "r1"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a skipped or unchecked routine is open: taken",
      "input": {
